{"id":"d06cd82e12837aa5","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-so-var.md","title":"Second-Order Variable","display":"df-so-var — Second-Order Variable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-so-var","aliases":["57-df-so-var"],"display":"df-so-var — Second-Order Variable","depends_on":["[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-arity]]","[[57-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-so-var"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-so-var</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-var — Second-Order Variable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b55affe36ee4719a\" href=\"?note=b55affe36ee4719a\" title=\"57-df-arity\">57-df-arity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定语言；固定与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不交的可数无限符号集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_2\">\\(U_2\\)</span> 和双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\mathbb N^+\\times\\mathbb N\\to U_2\">\\(\\iota:\\mathbb N^+\\times\\mathbb N\\to U_2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。二阶变量是语法符号，不是随结构载体改变的实际关系；赋值的取值范围由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9fd59242fb4200e\" href=\"?note=b9fd59242fb4200e\" title=\"57-df-so-assignment\">57-df-so-assignment</a> 规定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_i^n\\coloneqq\\iota(n,i),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\coloneqq\\{X_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_i^n\\coloneqq\\iota(n,i),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\coloneqq\\{X_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\cap S=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall m,n\\ge1\\quad(m\\ne n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_{S,m}^2\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2=\\emptyset).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\cap S=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall m,n\\ge1\\quad(m\\ne n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_{S,m}^2\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2=\\emptyset).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式把可数无限的变量符号集声明为 P(A^n) 的子集，有限载体上即可能不成立。修复的是语法符号与语义取值的混淆，变量名和元数索引均保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"b9fd59242fb4200e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言；固定与 $S$ 不交的可数无限符号集 $U_2$ 和双射 $\\iota:\\mathbb N^+\\times\\mathbb N\\to U_2$。$n\\ge1$，$i\\in\\mathbb N$。二阶变量是语法符号，不是随结构载体改变的实际关系；赋值的取值范围由 [[57-df-so-assignment]] 规定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"U_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\mathbb N^+\\times\\mathbb N\\to U_2","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X_i^n\\coloneqq\\iota(n,i),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2\\coloneqq\\{X_i^n:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\ge1}\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S^2\\cap S=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall m,n\\ge1\\quad(m\\ne n\\to\\mathrm{Var}_{S,m}^2\\cap\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2=\\emptyset).","display":true}],"bytes":1108,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9fd59242fb4200e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$。$\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$ 取 [[57-df-so-var]]，$n\\ge1$，$X\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S,n}^2$，$R\\subseteq A^n$；$\\eta$ 为候选函数，修改函数的参数 $\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}_S^2(\\mathfrak A)$。保留 $\\gamma[X/R]$ 的变量在前、关系在后次序。"},{"id":"433037f9b53db530","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言，项、原子公式与二阶变量取 [[57-df-term]]、[[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-so-var]]。所有构造子产生带标签的有限语法树。保留本文件原来的原始联结词 $\\neg,\\land,\\lor$；本文件内 $\\alpha\\to\\beta$、$\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\beta$ 是下式规定的缩写，而不是加入新的树构造子。$\\iota_2$ 是一阶公式到二阶语法的显式翻译。$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}$。"},{"id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"ex